 About

╭ About ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ktask RS · <ver> · ktask-dev                                                                                │
│A visual workspace for supervising AI coding tasks.                                                         │
│                                                                                                            │
│Tasks, revisions, approvals, history and events:                                                            │
│relational SQLite. Import/export uses real files.                                                           │
│Execution, checks, review, validation, remediation and task breakdown are real,                             │
│run by Codex, Claude Code or OpenCode per role.                                                             │
│                                                                                                            │
│Production and development use separate data roots.                                                         │
│--demo never opens SQLite. --paths shows data locations.                                                    │
│                                                                                                            │
